Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.89,0:23:13.30,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}迎接属于我的勇敢 在崛起后便爆发
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.43,0:23:16.92,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}就让我献上S级的营救吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.08,0:23:20.41,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}若是能守护你的话
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.87,0:23:26.98,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}最弱杰作降临
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.44,0:23:30.24,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}「最强的我」即为我的使命
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.15,0:14:40.96,song,,0,0,0,,The time has come to pack away all the joys
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.15,0:14:40.96,song,,0,0,0,,时光将所有的喜悦裹挟带走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.65,0:14:47.67,song,,0,0,0,,You don't wanna hear my apology
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.65,0:14:47.67,song,,0,0,0,,你不会想听到我的道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.67,0:14:49.07,song,,0,0,0,,Get it off my chest
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.67,0:14:49.07,song,,0,0,0,,全部说出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.07,0:14:50.67,song,,0,0,0,,I would do my best
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.07,0:14:50.67,song,,0,0,0,,我会尽力做到最好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.67,0:14:52.17,song,,0,0,0,,I know what you fear
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.67,0:14:52.17,song,,0,0,0,,我知道你在害怕什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.17,0:14:56.38,song,,0,0,0,,Similarities we possess
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.17,0:14:56.38,song,,0,0,0,,我们的相似之处
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.38,0:14:59.44,song,,0,0,0,,Never will I pass the test
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.38,0:14:59.44,song,,0,0,0,,我永远都不会通过测试
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.36,0:15:02.32,song,,0,0,0,,The scene is fading
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.36,0:15:02.32,song,,0,0,0,,那一幕幕渐渐褪色
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.32,0:15:05.63,song,,0,0,0,,Can my soul be put to rest
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.32,0:15:05.63,song,,0,0,0,,我的灵魂会得到安息吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.63,0:15:10.49,song,,0,0,0,,Death is gonna come for me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.63,0:15:10.49,song,,0,0,0,,死亡会降临我身
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.49,0:15:13.07,song,,0,0,0,,Be the change I couldn't be
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.49,0:15:13.07,song,,0,0,0,,成就我无法实现的改变
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.42,0:15:17.31,song,,0,0,0,,Can you find a life that's like fairytales
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.42,0:15:17.31,song,,0,0,0,,你能找到一种童话式的生活吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.31,0:15:19.53,song,,0,0,0,,Far from this tragedy
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.31,0:15:19.53,song,,0,0,0,,与这样的悲剧毫不相干
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.53,0:15:21.92,song,,0,0,0,,Sad you had to wait for me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.53,0:15:21.92,song,,0,0,0,,很遗憾 你要等待我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.42,0:15:24.63,song,,0,0,0,,Feels like an eternity
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.42,0:15:24.63,song,,0,0,0,,一场永恒的等待
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.50,0:15:27.69,song,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me for my sins
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.50,0:15:27.69,song,,0,0,0,,请原谅我的罪过
